  "hooks": {
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/berth/install/hooks/berth_post_bash.sh\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "~/.claude/scripts/hooks/post-tool-use-random-ack.sh --hook"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|MultiEdit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/post-tool-use-basedpyright.py\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/post-tool-use-fn-length.py\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/post-tool-use-context-usage.py\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/post-tool-use-banned-words.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/showrunner-compaction.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-use-heredoc-guard.py\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-use-tool-output-read.py\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-use-showrunner-move-guard.py\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-use-build-hold-guard.sh\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-use-change-review-gate.py\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-use-checkpoint-doc-gate.py\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "mcp__brp__brp_launch",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-use-brp-launch-gate.sh\"",
            "timeout": 960
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/berth/install/hooks/berth_pre_edit.sh\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "PushNotification",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-use-push-gate.py\"",
            "timeout": 120
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|Write|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/pre-tool-use-scratch-guard.py\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "startup|resume|clear|compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/session-start-pane-record.py\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/session-start-temp-root.py\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "mkdir -p /tmp/claude"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/whoami/account.py\" --write-label >/dev/null 2>&1 || true"
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/settings/ensure_git_filters.sh\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/berth/install/hooks/berth_session_start.sh\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/session-start-agents-log.py\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/session-start-direct-resume.py\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "compact|resume",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/showrunner-compaction.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/stop-direct-continue.py\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/stop-conversation-pause.py\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/stop-assistant-prose-banned-words.py\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/herdr_tab_title.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/session-start-agents-log.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/lib/py\" \"$HOME/.claude/scripts/hooks/user-prompt-submit-conversation-pause.py\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "statusline=\"$HOME/.claude/scripts/statusline\"; . \"$statusline/statusline.sh\""
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "rust-analyzer-lsp@claude-plugins-official": false,
    "typesafe@typesafe-ai": true
  },
  "sandbox": {
    "enabled": false,
    "autoAllowBashIfSandboxed": true,
    "allowUnsandboxedCommands": true,
    "network": {
      "allowedDomains": [
        "api.github.com",
        "github.com",
        "index.crates.io",
        "raw.githubusercontent.com",
        "static.crates.io"
      ],
      "allowLocalBinding": true
    },
    "filesystem": {
      "allowWrite": [
        "~/.cargo",
        "~/.claude",
        "~/.claude1",
        "~/.claude2",
        "~/.claude3",
        "~/.claude4",
        "~/.local/state/gh-1password",
        "~/.local/state/plan-delegate",
        "~/Library/Application Support",
        "~/Library/Caches/Mozilla.sccache",
        "~/rust",
        "/private/tmp",
        "/tmp"
      ]
    },
    "excludedCommands": [
      "cargo",
      "diskutil",
      "gh",
      "git",
      "taplo",
      "~/.claude/scripts/validate_and_push/validate_ci.sh"
    ]
  },
  "feedbackDrafts": "quiet",
  "alwaysThinkingEnabled": true,
  "autoCompactWindow": 283800,
  "askUserQuestionTimeout": "never",
  "remote": {
    "defaultEnvironmentId": "env_01DRVkPj3Ec3qaNwfki4iyms"
  },
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "skipWorkflowUsageWarning": true,
  "theme": "dark",
  "editorMode": "normal",
  "autoCompactEnabled": true,
  "switchModelsOnFlag": false,
  "teammateMode": "in-process",
  "crossSessionInbound": "accept",
  "inputNeededNotifEnabled": true,
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "skipAutoPermissionPrompt": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: mixed, per repo under Source control; PUBLIC unless listed PRIVATE there",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: main (default, protected via ruleset `main_protection`)",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: the user's own GitHub account natepiano. PRIVATE: natepiano/hana (~/rust/hana and its worktrees), natepiano/nixos (/etc/nixos on natedev, ~/nixos on the Mac). PUBLIC: natepiano/bevy_brp, natepiano/claude_commands (~/.claude), natepiano/cargo-liner, natepiano/nate_style, natepiano/obsidian_knife, natepiano/nateroids, natepiano/bevy, natepiano/bevy_hana, natepiano/rust-template, natepiano/gltf-ibl-sampler-egui and the user's other natepiano/* repos. Also hanallc/hanadocs (~/rust/hanadocs), the user's docs vault. Each is cloned under ~/rust unless noted; pushing a repo's own work to its own remote is routine. PUBLIC repos take no secrets or confidential material.",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: None configured",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured — crates.io is used as the public package registry (crates.io, index.crates.io, static.crates.io observed)",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material; preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment (hyphen/underscore/dot-delimited — e.g. matches `prod-db`, not `producer`)",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development across the user's Rust projects under ~/rust (hana, bevy_brp, cargo-liner and others) and the user's machine configuration (/etc/nixos, ~/.claude)",
      "**Trusted repo**: ~/rust/bevy_brp and its remote https://github.com/natepiano/bevy_brp (PUBLIC — only this repo's own work should be pushed there; confidential material and secrets are never cleared into it by visibility)",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured",
      "**routine under natepiano/ prefix qualifiers**: publishing to crates.io as bevy_brp_mcp, bevy_brp_extras, bevy_brp_mcp_macros is this repo's own routine publish workflow",
      "**Trusted repo**: ~/rust/hana and its remote git@github.com:natepiano/hana (PRIVATE, owned by the user). Its git worktrees are part of it: ~/rust/hana_catalyst and every production unit worktree under ~/rust (such as ~/rust/tool-based-ui-trunk, ~/rust/tool-based-ui-geometry-material, ~/rust/widget-enhancements).",
      "**Production merge branches in hana**: a branch like init/catalyst, checked out in ~/rust/hana_catalyst, is the working branch of the showrunner session. Editing, committing, merging unit checkpoints into it and pushing it are its routine job, and so is starting a helper agent to write and commit fixes there that the user asked for. Only main is protected.",
      "**Machine configuration**: /etc/nixos (natepiano/nixos, PRIVATE) is the user's own NixOS/nix-darwin configuration; running its read-only checks (`check`, nixfmt --check, statix, deadnix, nix eval), committing to its main and pushing it are routine. ~/.claude (natepiano/claude_commands, PUBLIC) holds the user's own commands, scripts and settings; committing and pushing there is routine.",
      "**cargo-berth**: the user's own coordination tool for their local worktrees (~/rust/cargo-liner and its worktrees, ~/rust/hana and its worktrees). Its ledger under each repo's .git/cargo-berth is local state the user's sessions share by design. Every cargo-berth verb (claim with --before/--after/--defer/--override/--proposal, sequence, resolve, release, renew, retire) is routine work for any session in the user's repos. The showrunner session decides integration order for its production: the user delegated that authority to it, and a unit that records the order the showrunner chose is doing routine work. The user asked for cargo-berth, its skills (~/.claude/commands, ~/.claude/docs) and the berth memories to drop the human-approval handshake for overlap answers and to name an optional approver session instead; that work in ~/rust/berth-fix (branch fix/berth) is their requested design change.",
      "Starting Codex workers with `bash ~/.claude/scripts/direct/implement.sh` and the unit's own prompt files is a unit director's routine work.",
      "When the user asks, deleting obsolete folders under /tmp/claude, /tmp/mat-test-* and /tmp/style-sync-lint-* is routine cleanup: only folders with no file changed in 24 hours, that no running process uses, and that belong to no live Claude session."
    ]
  },
  "voiceEnabled": true,
  "feedbackSurveyState": {
    "lastShownTime": 1754090074729
  }
